{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694 <strong>Fast-Paced and Fluid Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/6ae7234de7495a46680c1d561bb2e7cf.poster.avif?t=1751063610\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/6ae7234de7495a46680c1d561bb2e7cf.webm?t=1751063610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/6ae7234de7495a46680c1d561bb2e7cf.mp4?t=1751063610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Face relentless waves of Void monsters with agile movement and precise aiming. Master timing and direction to clear enemies in style! Experience the tension and rhythm of a top-down bullet hell shooter with satisfying feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udfae Enjoy the game with your choice of control scheme: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>keyboard and mouse, mouse-only, or game controller.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Diverse Characters \u00d7 Customizable Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/6b3000d717587ca338eaef4f27a3449f.avif?t=1751063610\" width=616 height=608 /></span> Unlock over 20 unique <strong>Followers</strong>, each with their own skills and control feel. Easy to pick up, yet deep to master\u2014combine skills and modules to build your own combat style. Every run is a brand new challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Strategic Skill Trees \u00d7 Randomized Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/f7e4c2cf4b71fc1f4b1f49069090f341.poster.avif?t=1751063610\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/f7e4c2cf4b71fc1f4b1f49069090f341.webm?t=1751063610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/f7e4c2cf4b71fc1f4b1f49069090f341.mp4?t=1751063610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Level up, branch out, and reinforce your build the way you want. Plan your upgrades carefully and select the best skill combinations from randomized choices to increase your chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Map Exploration and Treasure Hunting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive into labyrinthine dungeons, uncover rare treasures and hidden events as you slowly unravel the mystery of the <strong>Realm of Black Mulberry</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd4a <strong>A Tale of Astral Legends and Salvation</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/b48d20f8d3856b47eab61616a0a9ca97.avif?t=1751063610\" width=616 height=414 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goddess has vanished into a dimensional rift, swallowed by the Realm of Black Mulberry. As an Astral Savior, summon your power and fight against the Void that devours all\u2014restore hope to the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras/50aec80c7f8164ccb25891a8c00be62e.avif?t=1751063610\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620430/extras_big/50aec80c7f8164ccb25891a8c00be62e.avif?t=1751063610 width=800 height=320 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>20+ unique characters, each with their own main weapon and skill tree</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>20 distinct Arcana, each with a dedicated skill tree</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>300+ skills to create your perfect combat build</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>8 base maps plus 6 high-difficulty variants</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Over 300 quests to complete</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>100+ collectible items to discover</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Original main story and specially designed boss fights</i></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survivor ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/7c45465dc9e5f7c17e17f3dab0332f1a342e5956.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Slayer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/ce8920dc5cde2147c026590df90e57892fe29a55.jpg"},{"name":"Goddess Lv7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/0c26270ed1028593da6f2aedd3dcfc43a026027a.jpg"},{"name":"Goddess Lv10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/0ced6c6486ae3b6ac04c440b26dd47c29fd5e67d.jpg"},{"name":"Origin Grasslands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/e8d51e139ccdee32a2f721e31978971eb66f3614.jpg"},{"name":"Molten Basin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/834a5a199d50ec1fb436825e8957cc236bdb4579.jpg"},{"name":"Sacred Water Bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/cd4e5cff33986d0c48eeb3e5d9c7084579e78baf.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620430/325752f6a259dc491643a9f58